# Bottom-rising pieces (calm room, forest-1-mob): they stand on the screen's bottom edge and reach two thirds of the
# view. Only thin stems, blades and stilt roots cross the floor band (y 272 to 320), with gaps the hero shows
# through; a room places them where --scan finds that band clear at every camera, and --check keeps the standing
# hero never hidden and the walking hero hidden at most 0.5 s at a time.
piece rise-fern 20 15
