# Bleed for the vertical parallax (the camera top moves 0 to 8 px, D111; factor 1.6 moves the foreground up to 12.8 px down
# and the shake adds 2.4 px more). `<piece>-foot` (1 tile row, to room y 384) sits under a standing piece, its x 32 px
# left of the piece, its top at the piece bottom: the stems and blades carry straight on down, darkening to near
# black (author, 2026-11-19: no roots or clods, roots are never seen through earth). `<piece>-top` (2 tile rows, room
# y -24 to 7) sits over a hanging piece, 32 px left of it: what the piece hangs from, open (limbs, a side branch
# and leaf clusters with sky between them); the piece's own rows 0 to 7, above the steady frame, are empty. The two `edge-*`
# pieces stand at room y 327 and are 4 tile rows tall (to y 391), so they need no foot.
