# Near pieces (D113, author 2026-11-20 and 2026-11-21: the foreground reads as right in front of the camera). Drawn by hand in
# art/parallax/forest/near/: three leaves (broad and tilted, small and turned, one seen edge-on), fern pinnae in three sizes and a
# rachis, every row typed; the placement lists (*.spec) say by hand where each goes, the later in front, the back leaves a tone
# lighter (a palette swap). `near/stamp.py` only copies them here: rerun it and replace everything after this comment.
# The softness is drawn: two or three outer steps (h, g and a dithered i on the unlit side, e, m and a dithered j toward the moon).
